    "updated_at": "2017-06-26T08:04:40Z",
    "body": "> The intention seems fine but did you check that we don't end up signaling the same slot multiple times per a single DOM change especially nested ones?\r\n\r\nThat shouldn't happen, as far as my understanding is correct. A slotchange is signaled at most once per a slot per a single DOM change for any tree structures. ",
